{"change_summary":"No additional amendments were required after review; the previously applied shrimp stage-model fixes stand as the final implementation. The workspace now uses deterministic signed-carry adult-to-berried and hatch transfers with reachable molt failures, preserves legacy/current saves via defaulted carry fields plus v4->v5/runtime stage-parameter wiring and invariant validation, and exposes readable total/sub-adult shrimp breakdowns across snapshot/API/TUI/harness surfaces with targeted regression coverage.","outstanding_risks":["Legacy-only maturation-days inputs still map to juvenile/sub-adult durations via the documented 60/40 split; callers that need different stage timing must set explicit stage durations or populate `state.shrimp_params` directly.","`cargo test --workspace` still reports the pre-existing `step_hours_leaves_state_untouched_when_clamps_precede_a_validation_error` failure from bead 6e5.7.1; this task did not address that regression.","The updated TUI stage breakdown is compile-validated and the core/harness/API surfaces are regression-tested, but there are still no dedicated TUI render snapshots or full end-to-end scenario reruns for the new text."],"steps":[{"description":"Review the final validation output and determine whether any new bead-scope amendments were required.","order":0,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Apply any additional review-requested code changes after the final review.","order":1,"status":"skipped"},{"description":"Retain the approved shrimp lifecycle, save-compatibility, runtime-validation, and outward-surface fixes as the final implementation for this bead.","order":2,"status":"completed"},{"description":"Record the focused and workspace-level validation evidence for the shipped changes.","order":3,"status":"completed"}],"validation_evidence":["Review stage outcome: approved with no actionable findings for this bead.","`cargo fmt --all` completed.","`cargo fmt --all --check` passed.","`cargo clippy --workspace` passed with no warnings.","`cargo test -p tank_core --lib` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test shrimp_population` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test save_load` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_core --test thermal_reproduction_penalty` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_scenarios` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_data` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_api snapshot` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_harness --lib` passed.","`cargo test -p tank_tui --no-run` passed.","`cargo test --workspace` completed with 277 passed and 1 failed; review confirmed the only failure is the pre-existing `step_hours_leaves_state_untouched_when_clamps_precede_a_validation_error` regression from bead 6e5.7.1, outside this task's scope."]}